Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:54:51 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 098/120] fix: CI findings on the imported upstream commits and
 the issue #13 test

- gui: the stream size limits and serializeFileMetaCapped (d33477b) are
  used on Windows only; they move to backup_streams_windows.go, where the
  linux lint no longer reports them unused. StreamStats' Linux comment
  follows ST1020.
- machinebackup (024b55b): TestFailedBackupSendsMail looks for the
  fork's wording of the VM ID error ("needs a Proxmox VM ID"); unchecked
  Quit/Close/Fprintf errors are discarded explicitly (errcheck).
- gui: TestChunkStateEncryptedDigests gives its client the manifest entry
  CloseDynamicIndex writes the index checksum into (it panicked).
